        "created_at": "2019-01-06T12:56:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Gus_Smedstad\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/e8c25b/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Gus_Smedstad:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I still don’t really have Setback down cold. I thought that High Risk Behavior increased damage Setback took from all sources. What it actually says is “increase damage done to Setback by villain targets.” So self-inflicted damage, damage from teammates, and environment damage doesn’t get boosted.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Truth be told, I thought exactly the same thing you did until I played this game. He just bumped up my list after playing these cards the right way.</p>",
